---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section>
  <div class="text-center text-white w-full max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
    <h2 class="gradient-title">Join the Omniverse</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-gold mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Omniversify is not a studio—it's a collaborative uprising. We seek raw,
      passionate talent eager to grow while reshaping narratives. No polished
      resumes required—just a hunger to create and a Moroccan identity.
    </p>

    <div class="flex gap-6 justify-center flex-wrap mb-12">
      <div class="bg-gold/10 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gold/20 max-w-[250px] text-center">
        <span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">🎨</span>
        <h3 class="text-base text-gold mb-2">Artists & 3D Modelers</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-content opacity-80">
          Bring Amazigh symbols, Moroccan architecture, and African landscapes
          to life.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gold/10 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gold/20 max-w-[250px] text-center">
        <span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">🎵</span>
        <h3 class="text-base text-gold mb-2">Musicians & Sound Designers</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-content opacity-80">
          Fuse Gnawa rhythms, Andalusian melodies, and desert winds into
          haunting soundtracks.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gold/10 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gold/20 max-w-[250px] text-center">
        <span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">📜</span>
        <h3 class="text-base text-gold mb-2">Writers & Historians</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-content opacity-80">
          Dive into archives and oral histories to craft stories that resonate
          with truth.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gold/10 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gold/20 max-w-[250px] text-center">
        <span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">💻</span>
        <h3 class="text-base text-gold mb-2">Programmers & Game Devs</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-content opacity-80">
          Build engines for worlds that defy colonial logic.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gold/10 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gold/20 max-w-[250px] text-center">
        <span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">🎙️</span>
        <h3 class="text-base text-gold mb-2">Voice Actors & Narrators</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-content opacity-80">
          Speak Tifinagh, Darija, and Arabic in games where language is power.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
